<title>BRAZIL: Brazilian weekly soybean and product shipment.</title>
<headline>Brazilian weekly soybean and product shipment.</headline>
<dateline>RIO DE JANEIRO 1996-11-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>SGS do Brasil reported the following Brazilian soybean and products shipments in the week ended October 27 compared with the previous week and the corresponding week last year, in tonnes -</p>
<p>	  Week ended   Week ended   Week ended</p>
<p>	    27/10/96     20/10/96     29/10/95</p>
<p> Bean	 26,000	    nil	  2,800</p>
<p> Meal	152,400	248,600	367,000</p>
<p> Oil	   7,000	 15,800	 47,500</p>
<p>The following are shipments so far in the 1996/97 February-January marketing year compared with the corresponding date in the previous year, in tonnes 	    1996/97	 1995/96</p>
<p> Bean   3,518,500     3,762,000</p>
<p> Meal   8,869,600     8,923,300</p>
<p> Oil    1,083,300     1,295,600 Note - Shipment this marketing</p>
<p>year includes 400,600 tonnes of Paraguayan origin. Previous marketing year includes 595,900 tonnes of Paraguayan origin.</p>
</text>
